{"sba-keyaki-11650":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズアワードありがとうございました。!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いままでに感じたことない緊張だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声援がきもちよかった。 \nすっごい楽しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ4SXNHEJ1HDWQCCRKJT3A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしの中では仲良し。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ4TV8CX9DB44W0Z5PBMJY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☺︎"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-11383":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばんわんU•ω•U\n \n \n \n 全国ツアーin仙台\n ありがとうございました\\❤︎/\n \n \n ずっと目標にしてた地元でのライブが叶ってすごく嬉しかったです!\n \n やったぁーーーー!\n \n \n 待っていてくださった皆さんありがとうございます!\n 楽しんでいただけたでしょうか?❀.*･ﾟ\n \n \n \n お花も本当にありがとうございます。\n 嬉しくてお家に花束にして持ち帰りました^^\n ドライフラワーにして大切に飾ります!\n いつもありがとう。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そして、私達のライブを見るために\n 今回、初めて宮城県に来たよ!って方が多いと思います。\n \n 少しでもライブ以外に満喫してもらえてたら嬉しいな～❀.*･ﾟ\n 私自身もずっと宮城で育ってきたのですが\n 改めてやっぱりいい場所だなって感じました。\n \n 全国ツアーがはじまって1番思うことは\n 兵庫、福岡、愛知、宮城、それぞれどの県も似てる部分がなくて、ここでしかない!素晴らしいものがあることに気づきました。\n ツアーでライブをするだけではなくこうやって各地方のことを知ってたくさん広めたいなって思いました!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 私達のことをあたたかく迎えて下さいました☀︎\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ06KENTP28FJY18TW2WPQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n こうやって迎えてもらえるともっと頑張ろう!って思えるしとてもほっこりしますね⋈*｡ﾟ\n \n \n メンバーにもたくさん宮城の美味しいものを食べてもらえてよかったな～\\❤︎/\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ07J958EXXS3DSQSFNVJ4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ08M282PKC3N3W4GBT9VN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n ずんだシェイクは絶品!!\n \n 2日目のライブ終わりに準備して下さっていたんです(><)!!\n \n ライブ終わりの冷たいシェイクはとても有難い!!\n \n \n \n 牛タンの「司」さんが暑い中私達のために外で焼いて下さいました(><)\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ09Q332Z55TRQ37K0TGE8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n この牛タン大好きなんですっ!!\n \n もちろん、美味しいお店はまだまだたくさんあります!!!\n \n \n \n 「SENDAI COFFEE STAD」さんも来て下さり\n 丁寧に時間をかけて1杯を作ってくれました✩°｡⋆\n チャイティーラテが個人的に大好きで、\n SENDAI COFFEE STADさんのは甘さが上品でとても美味しかったです!\n 是非、宮城県のみなさん、そして宮城に来た時には味わってもらいたいです❤︎\"\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ0AR3882NESP4AVWHQQE6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n (あっ、、、まさかのスッピン。\n でもどうしてもこのチャイティーを載せたい。\n 許してくださいませ。。)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n また宮城に戻ってきます!!\n その時はまた必ず会いに来て下さい⋈*｡ﾟ\n \n \n これからもたくさん宮城の良さを広めて行くぞーー!\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ0BQZ9AQ2AEQ15X5DSDNX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n ♡石森虹花♡"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-sakura-58667":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あけましておめでとうございます🌅\n今年もよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2025年が始まってすぐ、\nBuddiesと会えてとっても嬉しかったです🐍\n今年も、一人一人と、\n2人だけの思い出をたくさん作りたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また会おうね☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD2JASBTD5TYME61R3E08F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD2MPJTTD4X956JH5SB1SP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD2PN8Y8A2FBD68A1ZYA06","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD2RM5FFPPNBXPGPDR39FD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD2TMWW4DCK10M6JR4MYSY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD2WKKZM7JQGPRFDYB573A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりなが写真とってくれた\nありがとう📷🤍！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD2ZFQF1G46FK3NVTKBSCT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD31NXNVM3KQ9KFZX76FJE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"💓💓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9thシングルのリアルミーグリでいただいたお花、東京と京都の分合わせてブログにのせさせてもらおうと思ってたらこんなに遅くなっちゃった \nごめんね😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この２日間もたくさんのお花うれしかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんないつも素敵なお花を本当にありがとう。\nお花大好きだからいつも休憩時間に眺めて幸せな気持ちになってるよ〜💐！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD33SQFCK1QC3RKZ3YFZ4Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD35WFWBMEXF7A32BDDEM7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD37VDZ3FZVE21FEMP48BD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD39TR8AAZB4NC7M9QPR6K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD3BR9MSSA301Y8YZN9A73","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD3DVW0E0VH09E7P1STRMB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD3FRGG26R3Q54CDYF482W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD3HNJTJW9DFNEYYJCJFCM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJD3KJATWMQHTY7NRDKXCXK","alt":""},{"t